{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0553_1000_p", "source_sha256": "024b08516a19e8a448283644da3eeaff82c5d51c54f20f4ecc17484e7e90d06f", "ja": "（朋花のコスプレグラビア企画の撮影日。動物園の宣伝\nポスターを撮るのだが……急遽場所が変更になった）", "zh": "（朋花的动物主题COS写真企划拍摄日。要拍摄动物园的宣传海报，可是……拍摄地点突然变更了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0553_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "510540abc7e74223e19c0098dbeab72ebf77ba3571d1ae9db3bbd298a064631c", "ja": "{$P$}さん～、\n説明をお願いできますか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生～，\n能请您说明一下吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0553_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d98ca2eafe0b008abfe645d864b4f2e32412d7dca454d392773985d85720a3cd", "ja": "ああ……。本来なら動物園でヒョウの赤ちゃんと\n一緒に撮影する予定だったんだが……。", "zh": "啊……本来是计划在动物园和小豹子一起拍摄的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0553_1003_p", "source_sha256": "2c66def6bf0b73ab2291486d7217e1fd4af62811ab6cecac257ea3d201deaa7d", "ja": "朋花の写真を見るなり、\n落ち着きがなくなったそうで……。", "zh": "据说一看到朋花的照片，\n就变得躁动不安了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0553_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "7a20079c679cbf4966b740e0eaaa12e755fad00eba7a0394263d5382d9af97dd", "ja": "なるほど～。だから安全のためにスタジオで……\nということですね～？", "zh": "原来如此～。所以为了安全起见，要在摄影棚里……是这个意思吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0553_1005_p", "source_sha256": "35f9f2d8e9d2d922dfc08916e3d494dd0f485911097a68ff827d4e64d165a140", "ja": "ああ。急な変更だったから、\n事前に説明できなくてすまなかった。", "zh": "啊。因为变更得很突然，\n没能提前说明，抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0553_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "2f66136ab81e41527016dcd7b0ec739f852dc9747219fd7d0dbd49550de324b2", "ja": "仕方がありません～。\nお互いの安全が第一ですから～。", "zh": "没办法呀～毕竟彼此的安全才是第一位的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0553_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "14a09e7f29218cc59a94651c791cb14cf9c81908ba762271151320dce5707192", "ja": "ですが……ヒョウの赤ちゃんに、\n聖母の愛を届けることができないのは、残念です。", "zh": "不过……没能将圣母的爱传递给小豹子，实在令人遗憾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0553_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "c2804c59f9b59de4aaa77d83565ce0888d20e39ad5ef596955998b2fb307dd7d", "ja": "愛らしい子豚ちゃん……いえ、仔ヒョウちゃんと\n仲良くなれると思っていたのですが……。", "zh": "原本以为能和可爱的小猪猪……不，是小豹子成为好朋友的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0553_1009_p", "source_sha256": "afbbc96d193b853800c6c5f0e684d15b21728e10d67d1b9a4729db0016a126ef", "ja": "そうだな。出来上がったポスターは、\nヒョウの獣舎にも貼ってくれるそうだ。", "zh": "是啊。据说完成的海报也会贴到豹子的兽舍里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0553_1010_p", "source_sha256": "277c8c22f5685485d11c1fb0e999e80700956fabc4543e1de2cc9ba3e58ca9f8", "ja": "写真越しになってしまうけど、仲良くなることは\n出来るんじゃないかな。", "zh": "虽然只能隔着照片，但应该也能和它们熟悉起来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0553_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "ca492bad1eb4d592b2fee0ee9983d671b45f447c5c50d3e908322fd56c1bbc98", "ja": "……ふふっ。そうですか～。では、写真でも慈愛が\n受け取れるように気合いを入れなくてはいけませんね。", "zh": "……呵呵，是吗～。那么，为了让人即使通过照片也能感受到慈爱，我也得好好打起精神来才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0553_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7f5c5e72e7b16e47cb4768d2142e87ef6b52a6efc3efd4cfcae3ea00a88600a4", "ja": "ああ！　俺もできる限りのことは協力するよ。", "zh": "啊！我也会尽我所能帮忙的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0553_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "644fd03aa785b8519884107d8cf7224732905edb7e7c52e782783b7686a3e5eb", "ja": "でしたら……\n私からお願いがあるのですが、いいですか～？", "zh": "既然这样……\n我有件事想拜托你，可以吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0553_1014_p", "source_sha256": "7977c5ea648a48aa26266f8c8cf9c49063ee0828ce12be3a1f9d93420d9eb2c1", "ja": "お願い？　なんだ？", "zh": "请求？是什么请求？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0553_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "71d17800beca4869291d5b8d314771f476be99f22b6f034635ba99fb89dcbca7", "ja": "約束してください。\n今度私を動物園に連れて行ってくれると。", "zh": "请答应我。\n下次带我去动物园。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0553_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c5c39f599c807493dd6abd3cd5864a28ff3863a1401c6579a139c49615fe5644", "ja": "動物、園……あっ！\nもしかして、ヒョウの赤ちゃんに会いに……？", "zh": "动物，园……啊！\n难道是要去见小豹子……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0553_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "3ea47b6476cc568c783e9a26ee89fa952a05f4e2ce38b32f3afa6efd7a9ea9ce", "ja": "うふふっ、よく分かっていますね～。\nそのとおりです～。", "zh": "呵呵，你很了解我嘛～\n就是这样～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0553_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "721468af32af31d3ebb7ea28ddeb6bbfc21018486120e17e5367abace05124d6", "ja": "今日、叶わなかった慈愛を聖母手ずから届けに……。\n{$P$}さん、約束ですよ～。", "zh": "今天，就由圣母亲手送上未能实现的慈爱……  \n{$P$}先生，约好了哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
